        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Signet Jewelers, Zale Corporation, Sterling Jewelers\n- Products/Brands: Zales, Kay Jewelers, Jared\n- Places: Delaware, United Kingdom, New York Stock Exchange\n- Topics: ownership, incorporation, acquisition\n\nFacts:\n- Sterling Jewelers was acquired in 1987 and became a wholly owned subsidiary of UK-based Signet Jewelers Limited.\n- Zale Corporation is an American jewelry retailer that was incorporated in Delaware in 1993.\n- Signet Jewelers owns and operates the companies Zales, Kay Jewelers, and Jared.\n- Signet Jewelers Limited is listed on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol SIG.",
